        <mxCell id="rules" value="UC-07: Allowed / Denied / VerificationFailed are decision outcomes, not Case states. Denied preserves existing trips. VerificationFailed blocks protected action.&#10;Free: Planned + Active &lt;= 2; inclusive trip days &lt;= 5. Paid: no Free-tier limits. Rechecks use latest verified membership and record changed snapshots.&#10;All transitions/actions are traced. A retry, referral or rejection does not itself close the Case. Pre-confirmation intake is outside this object lifecycle." vertex="1" parent="1" style="fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=18;fontColor=#222222;strokeColor=#555555;fillColor=#ffffff;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=19;">
